@startuml
title Ubuntu 虚拟机容器部署图（AI-辅助）
top to bottom direction
node "Windows\n浏览器 / 烟测客户端" as client
node "Ubuntu VM 192.168.125.129\nDocker Compose 默认栈" {
  node "frontend\nNginx :8080" as frontend
  node "gateway\nJava 21 :18080" as gateway
  node "业务容器 / Java 21" as services {
    artifact "space-service :18081\naccess-service :18082\nbilling-service :18083\npass-service :18084\nanalytics-service :18085" as business
  }
  database "MySQL 8.4 :3306\nparking_space / parking_access\nparking_billing / parking_pass\nparking_analytics\n各服务仅访问自有 schema" as mysql
  database "Redis :6379\n已保存报表缓存" as redis
}
node "Nacos profile\nVM 未部署 / 未验证" as nacos
client --> frontend : HTTP :8080
client --> gateway : 烟测 :18080
frontend --> gateway : /api/ 反向代理
gateway --> services : 固定服务地址
services --> mysql : 独立账号
services ..> redis : analytics 读穿缓存
note bottom of services
跨服务调用：access → pass / space / billing，
pass → space（只读），analytics → access（只读）。
MySQL 保存所有权威状态；Redis 不可用时回源。
end note
note bottom of nacos
Windows 本机曾独立验证 Nacos 注册发现与配置热更新；
VM 默认栈未启用 Nacos，Sentinel 未接入。
end note
@enduml
